n cookie/tracker classifications against the publicly disclosed Privacy Policy. Updates logs and offers reporting capabilities Try Now Reflectiz’s fully remote scanning architecture is designed to meet DORA’s strict ICT resilience and security requirements No Data Access Operates externally with no code insertion or access to sensitive financial data, minimizing ICT risk and attack surface. Full Visibility Scans every part of the site, including iFrames and third-party elements, to ensure comprehensive oversight of ICT dependencies and data flows. Fast Onboarding Requires only a URL, no production access or lengthy vetting required, enabling rapid deployment for DORA compliance. Zero Performance Impact Adds no code, ensuring no effect on platform speed or latency, which is critical for uninterrupted financial services. Security Insights Magecart & Web-skimming September 22, 2026 7 min read StyleSmuggler: The Magento Flaw That Turns a Template Into a Backdoor Pentesting September 10, 2026 7 min read Agentic Pentesting, Explained: A Full Walkthrough of Reflectiz Offensive Hub PCI Compliance September 8, 2026 9 min read PCI DSS Meets CTEM: Mapping v4.0.1 to the Five Stages of Exposure Management Privacy September 1, 2026 6 min read Hims & Hers Lawsuit: FTC and Two States Sue Over Website Tracking Pixels Streamline regulatory compliance to avoid data violations and hefty fines Continuously track sensitive actions including unauthorized data collection, network requests, cookie/pixel tracking, and more: Ensuring compliance across all third parties. Get Personalized Demo Platform Platform Overview How it Works Web Exposure Management Exposure Rating Blocking Industries eCommerce Financial Services Healthcare Solutions Web Skimming and Magecart PCI Compliance Web Supply Chain Risks Website Privacy Enforcement Tag Manager Security Web Asset Management Resources Blog Learning Hub Customers Company About Us Media Careers Events Partners Contact us Sign up Login Contact Us Sup