      "url": "https://www.reflectiz.com/careers/co/boston-usa/00.B6C/customer-success-manager/all",
      "description": "Job opportunity: Customer Success Manager Customers Platform Overview How it Works Exposure Rating Remote Monitoring Blocking Industries eCommerce Financial Services Healthcare Solutions Security Hub Web Skimming and Magecart Web Supply Chain Risks Tag Manager Security Web Asset Management DORA Compliance Privacy Hub Website Privacy Enforcement Tag Manager Security GDPR Web Compliance CCPA Web Compliance HIPAA Tracking Offensive Hub Agentic PT ASV Scanner (Coming Soon) PCI Module PCI DSS 4.0.1 Compliance Resources Blog Learning Hub Company About Us Media Careers Events Partners Plans Login Try for free Login Try for free ← All Jobs Customer Success Manager Boston, USA Full-time About The Position About Reflectiz Reflectiz empowers organizations to secure their websites and digital assets against modern web threats. Our award-winning, agentless remote sandbox monitors every first, third, and fourth-party application running on a customer's site, with no installation and no embedded code, automatically detecting and prioritizing security, privacy, and compliance risks before they become tomorrow's headline. We call the blind spot behind these risks runtime blindness, and closing it is the reason we exist. Backed by $22M in Series B funding, Reflectiz is trusted by global enterprises across financial services, e-commerce, and healthcare to safeguard their data, users, and brand reputation. We don't just watch, either. Our Offensive Hub runs continuous agentic pentesting, AI agents that map, attack, validate, and report on your real attack surface around the clock. Headquartered in Tel Aviv, with hubs in Boston and Sydney, we're expanding fast in North America, and this role sits at the center of that build-out. Join us to help write the playbook for what customer success looks like here. About the Role As our Customer Success Manager for North America, you'll plan and execute the strategy that turns new accounts into long-term, expanding relationships. You'll provide both strategic guidance and hands-on support, serving as the bridge between customers and the broader Reflectiz team. This isn't a support seat. When a customer needs something, you go get it, whichever door in the building you have to knock on. What you hear from customers doesn't stop at your desk. It reaches the people who can actually act on it. Requirements • Own a portfolio of North American customers, from onboarding through adoption, expansion, and renewal. • Develop Success Plans with customers, outlining goals and key performance indicators, and guide them toward hitting those targets. • Run a regular cadence of check-ins and Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs), from day-to-day practitioners to C-level stakeholders. • Serve as the primary point of contact for technical questions and escalations, and drive them to resolution no matter who needs to get pulled in. • Explain the WHO, WHAT, and WHERE behind every risk Reflectiz surfaces: who the component is, what it's doing, and where it's sending customer data. • Flag new exposure risks the moment Reflectiz surfaces them, before customers find them on their own. • Track account health closely, catching problems before they become churn and opportunities before they become someone else's win. • Speak up for what customers need, loudly enough that it actually reaches the people building the product. • Identify and pursue opportunities to expand Reflectiz's footprint across a customer's organization. • Champion customer advocacy through case studies, referrals, and product feedback that actually gets used. Advantage Background in cybersecurity, or experience working alongside security and compliance teams Working knowledge of HTTP, DNS, JavaScript, and browser behavior Familiarity with SIEM/SOAR platforms (e.g., Splunk, JIRA) or REST API-based integrations Familiarity with PCI DSS or other regulatory frameworks Apply your candidacy now Platform Platform Overview How it Works Web Exposure Manag